      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Its a problem but you got to let the idea of reporting children go. Children in the game are here to stay, they make up far too large of a market and population in the game. Having age resticted worlds would be better, even if it wouldnt really solve the issue either. After all, we all did it when we were younger and it wasnt any harder.",
