  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-04-12T01:38:17.455Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Pretty self explanatory. There's been a lot of immature children in VRChat ever since the launch of the Quest version, and the situation hasn't been any better. There's even a BBC article covering how children can easily enter worlds and/or environments that are clearly only meant for adults. Plus, it would also be nice to have an underage report feature built in so that underage children can't log in to VRChat until they meet the age requirements, or at all, depending on the situation at hand.",
